{
  "schema": "daedalus.minigames.realm_arcades/v1",
  "about": "Which realms host arcade cabinets. Patterns match catalog ids (fnmatch). Edit, then run tools/minigames/realm_cabinets.py. 'options' maps a placed desktop game to its SetGameOption value. Realm ids taken from docs/REALMS.md names are unconfirmed proposals (id_status in the output).",
